# Bare dotfiles repo: work tree is $HOME, so ignore everything by default
# and whitelist only what is tracked. Add a new dotfile with:
#   config add -f <path>     (then whitelist it below)
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!.zshrc
!.tmux.conf

!.config/
.config/*
!.config/nvim/
!.config/nvim/**

# Claude Code: config only. Never transcripts (projects/), prompt history,
# installed plugins, or machine-local caches.
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/statusline-command.sh
!.claude/keybindings.json
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/claude-island-state.py
